Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.74,0:18:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！谁... 谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:09.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,路过的英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:11.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没有时间了 我们快走！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.31,0:18:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.17,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,机场！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.89,0:18:14.17,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,机场！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.77,0:18:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你... 你们...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:29.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:35.53,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,请抱牢我！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.69,0:18:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪用得着提醒啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.28,0:18:46.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.37,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一次！Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:52.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.12,0:18:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.23,0:19:00.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞... 飞起来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:32.90,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:37.93,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亮太
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？刚才电话里还说“突然有急事”
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:20:00.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奶奶！爱...啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给她的礼物 第一双鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:06.24,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！小空 小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:08.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,很漂亮的 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:10.89,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,亏得你们找到了同款鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:14.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,从机场到家里路上的全部鞋店 我们都扫了一遍...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.12,0:21:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才这么晚回来...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:17.90,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:20.04,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,没... 没什么事情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:26.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,由由阿姨 这段日子受你照顾了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:28.50,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:32.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来按下按钮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.67,0:21:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小白 记得带特产回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:53.96,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.55,0:21:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:57.36,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Miracle哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.40,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1042,970)}奇迹愈卫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.95,0:22:13.92,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,大家来一起念咒语 Cure Up Rapapa！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:49.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,终于回到蓝天大地了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.67,0:23:52.72,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小空能回爸爸妈妈身边了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.92,0:23:55.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 太好了 公主
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.38,0:23:56.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！那个人是！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:23:58.45,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？谁？谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.05,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海阔天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:04.21,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,去蓝天大地！再遇崇敬的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.23,0:01:14.44,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（冲上蓝天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:20.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 超越云巅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:25.58,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飞吧！向着海阔天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:33.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空万里 美丽蓝天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:38.46,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨后初霁天空棱镜折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:42.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝天的景色预告着有好事发生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.18,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（蓝天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.18,0:01:48.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要确认一下 便伸直了双手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:53.06,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名为希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.15,0:01:55.02,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速紧握！紧紧握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:59.61,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,战胜绝望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.99,0:02:03.58,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦干眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:06.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已经做好准备了吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:09.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飞跃而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:09.00,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(让我们张开勇气之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:14.71,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飞 朝气蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:19.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把烦躁化为光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:24.68,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未来的图景 充满着可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:29.43,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,与在同一片蓝天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:32.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起唤起通向明日的奇迹！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.35,0:02:40.23,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海阔天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.02,0:22:30.69,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了!! 晴空万里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:35.25,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是能实现梦想与心愿的蔚蓝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:38.03,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,打开心中的麦克风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.03,0:22:39.84,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,轻轻哼唱起！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:42.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,希望的旋律♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.68,0:22:45.14,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}今天心情愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.14,0:22:47.10,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}如果能与你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.10,0:22:49.77,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就能打开心灵+门扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.85,0:22:52.56,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}稍等片刻！我已经激动到势不可挡!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.56,0:22:54.23,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}笑容也在合唱！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.36,0:22:56.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧☆我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.04,0:23:03.46,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD5B8FD&\3c&HBD9CDF&\4c&HBE9EDE&}还是那条街 {\c&HEBC278&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&}就像平日里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:09.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在那里 这便是奇迹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.29,0:23:11.63,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的宝贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.34,0:23:16.01,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都过来！传开这韵律
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:20.27,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,手牵起手 心连起心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:26.35,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,用温暖的关怀 培育出的勇气 是无穷无穷的∞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:30.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,积极的图标是标记
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:34.78,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,想要更了解！这海阔天空的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.78,0:23:38.48,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们展开翅膀 飞向蓝天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:39.87,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,连接起人与人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:42.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 笑容的圆环！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
